{
  "name": "YouTube comments → AI theme summary → Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## YouTube comments → AI theme summary → Google Sheets\n\nPaste a YouTube video link into the form. The workflow collects the most-liked comments, asks an AI model to group them into themes (with tone, quotes and viewer questions), and appends one summary row per video to a Google Sheet.\n\n**Who it's for:** creators, marketers and product teams who want to know what viewers think without reading thousands of comments.\n\n### Setup (5 minutes)\n1. **Apify token:** create a free account at apify.com → Settings → API & Integrations. In the *Get comments* node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **AI model:** add your OpenAI credential to the chat model node (or swap it for Anthropic, Gemini or a local model).\n3. **Google Sheet:** create a sheet with headers `date, videoTitle, videoChannel, videoUrl, commentsAnalyzed, topComment, topCommentLikes, summary`, then pick it in the last node.\n4. Activate, open the form URL and paste a link.\n\n### Cost\nThe comments step uses the pay-per-result *YouTube Comments Scraper* on Apify (charged per comment delivered; Apify's free plan includes monthly credit). 200 comments cost a few cents.\n\n*Disclosure: the scraper is built by the template author.*",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "0a091f23-4512-42e8-89b7-8a109f9dc030",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Paste a video\nAny video, Short or live replay link. Choose how many top comments to analyze.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 220,
        "color": "7"
      },
      "id": "dec134f7-2e9b-4737-bd56-dbfca51fef99",
      "name": "Step1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Get comments\nCalls the Apify Actor synchronously and returns one item per comment (text, likes, replies, creator hearts).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 220,
        "color": "7"
      },
      "id": "7e80273f-4f95-4a31-8660-629a8c6cd129",
      "name": "Step2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Summarize\nKeeps the 300 most-liked comments and asks the model for themes, tone, questions and one next step.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": "7"
      },
      "id": "b496772e-0694-4f3c-b64f-ee90bc9c8e19",
      "name": "Step3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Save\nOne row per video in your sheet.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": "7"
      },
      "id": "d7f6cd39-e6f6-4745-b0f2-be8d638df0a0",
      "name": "Step4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "What do viewers think?",
        "formDescription": "Paste a YouTube video link to get an AI summary of its comments.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Video URL",
              "placeholder": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=...",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Comments to analyze",
              "fieldType": "number",
              "placeholder": "200"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "78127971-f837-439c-8d41-856159ecc79b",
      "name": "Paste a YouTube video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -60,
        40
      ],
      "webhookId": "9e9fd7ae-4132-49b0-a003-d5e1a505fe2c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sblabs~youtube-comments-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items?timeout=300",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"videos\": [\"{{ $json['Video URL'] }}\"],\n  \"maxComments\": {{ $json['Comments to analyze'] || 200 }},\n  \"sort\": \"top\",\n  \"includeReplies\": false\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 310000
        }
      },
      "id": "bf9fafa3-4538-42e7-beef-62b4b772631a",
      "name": "Get comments (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Keep only real comments (error rows have status \"error\"), most-liked first\nconst rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.status === 'ok' && !r.isReply);\nif (!rows.length) {\n  const err = $input.first()?.json || {};\n  throw new Error(`No comments returned: ${err.errorMessage || err.error || 'check the video link'}`);\n}\nrows.sort((a, b) => (b.likes || 0) - (a.likes || 0));\nconst top = rows.slice(0, 300);\nconst lines = top.map(r => `- (${r.likes} likes${r.isHeartedByCreator ? ', hearted by creator' : ''}) ${String(r.text).replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').slice(0, 500)}`);\nconst v = rows[0];\nreturn [{ json: {\n  videoUrl: v.videoUrl,\n  videoTitle: v.videoTitle,\n  videoChannel: v.videoChannel,\n  commentsAnalyzed: top.length,\n  topComment: top[0].text.slice(0, 300),\n  topCommentLikes: top[0].likes,\n  commentList: lines.join('\\n'),\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "3ce0c7cd-566a-4773-9ac8-174d8b7dd50a",
      "name": "Top comments + prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Below are the most-liked comments under the YouTube video \"{{ $json.videoTitle }}\" by {{ $json.videoChannel }}.\n\n1. Group them into 5-8 themes. For each theme give a short name, roughly how many comments fit it, the tone (positive, negative or mixed) and one short representative quote.\n2. List the 3 most common questions or requests viewers have.\n3. End with one sentence: what should the creator do next, based on these comments?\n\nKeep it under 350 words. Plain text, no markdown tables.\n\nComments:\n{{ $json.commentList }}"
      },
      "id": "bd9736d2-3b25-4244-a583-825d617e0bd0",
      "name": "Summarize themes",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        700,
        40
      ]
    },
